  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A ship is moving away from a vertical building at a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> and sounds its whistle with frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>. The sound from the whistle is reflected from the building back towards the ship. The speed of sound in air is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"340\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. What is the frequency of the whistle as observed on the ship after the reflection from the building?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{33f}{34}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{34f}{33}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{33f}{35}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{35f}{33}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
